          {
            "kind": "heading",
            "level": 1,
            "text": "Quillmoor ledger",
            "marks": [],
            "places": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "The harbour ledger of Quillmoor records that the night ferry left at a quarter past nine on every weekday of the winter season.",
            "marks": [],
            "places": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "Its keeper, Odalys Brenn, wrote each departure in green ink and each delay in red, so that a reader could count the late crossings at a glance.",
            "marks": [],
            "places": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "In the third winter the ferry ran late on forty-one nights, most of them in the weeks when fog lay over the eastern breakwater.",
            "marks": [],
            "places": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "The town council answered by moving the departure to half past eight, which cut the late crossings to nine in the winter that followed.",
            "marks": [],
            "places": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "日本語の段落もある。港の帳簿は町の図書館に今も保管されている。",
            "marks": [],
            "places": []
          },
          {
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "text": "Filler paragraph number 0 keeps the extractor sure that this page is an article with running text enough to be worth reading, sentence after sentence.",
